	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
おおあめ　ふらせて
カミナリを　おっことすのは[Ctrl2:LineFeed ]
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
大雨　降らせて
カミナリを　落っことすのは[Ctrl2:LineFeed ]
他の　ポケモンだもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>●WHITE
・主人公の背後から叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r14r0201_boy2_01b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちがうもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
おおあめ　ふらせて
かぜを　びゅーびゅー　させるのは[Ctrl2:LineFeed ]
ほかの　ポケモンだもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>違うもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
大雨　降らせて
風を　びゅーびゅー　させるのは[Ctrl2:LineFeed ]
他の　ポケモンだもーん！[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>●BLACK
・主人公の背後から叫ぶ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>弟</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
